2026-07-27T11:56:46.5193231Z i /tmp/RtmpxuElco/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5193768Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5194398Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5194947Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5196093Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5197687Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:56:46.5198691Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
